  <content>
  <section><para dir="ltr">Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="2aeff761-3d80-478a-9dda-33e3b35ba77f"><problem><para>
      <para>Select <emphasis>three</emphasis> values for \(r\) that indicate a positive slope for the line of best fit.</para>
      </para></problem><solution><para>["1", "0.5", "0.8"]</para><para>
      <para>The correct answers are 1, 0.5, 0.8. </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
